Z||000021||Gold-86SE||08-14-2000||02:29 PM||||<BR><B>***New Posting to this thread!***</B><BR>I did not want to start another thread on the same subject.<P>Sorry to bring this back up, but I watched <I><B>Wayne's World</B></I> again this weekend and want to tell you what I saw.<P>I saw the Fiero in three, yes three, different scenes, and it is either a Gold 86 GT or 87 GT.<P>Of course, the one scene we mostly know is the street hockey scene, "game on!"<P>Here are the other two scenes:<BR>This scene is in the movie intro where the guys are in the AMC Gremlin headbanging to <I>Bohemian Rhapsody</I>. Watch as the camera pans Garth, he is driving.  You will see the Fiero's tailend while it is parked on the street. The Fiero is not parallel parked it is pulled in diagonally facing the sidewalk.<P>The other scene is where Wayne and Garth are in the autoshop paying for repairs and inspection. Watch behind Garth, as he is playing with the impact gun, you will see the Gold Fiero parked behind the autoshop.<P>Zang! Party on.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gold-86SE (Fiero Collector)||||reg||1
